    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i haven't really talked to anyone. i feel like if i start talking, i'll just fall apart and i don't think i can handle that. talking just reminds me of what's missing. honestly, the hardest part is that i feel like i'm just existing in a ghost version of my life. there's no color left. everything he loved is still here but he's not, and it's like the world is just moving on without any reason. i just feel so exhausted by all of it.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
